omaxian-calamares-settings (0.2.1) excalibur; urgency=medium

  * UEFI: after the bootloader job, mirror the stub grub.cfg from EFI/omaxian to EFI/debian and EFI/BOOT. The signed GRUB looks in /EFI/debian, so booting through the removable fallback stopped at a grub> prompt.

